1
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:12,970
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:15,880
[Episode 8]

3
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,760
With a full scholarship,

4
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,200
she was admitted to the drama major
at King's College in the UK.

5
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:21,920
It is reported that

6
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:24,200
there were only three people
who got a full scholarship

7
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,120
for the drama major in this school.

8
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:25,830
Enough.

9
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:30,030
All that you've collected
is such useless garbage.

10
00:01:30,030 --> 00:01:30,789
What else?

11
00:01:35,410 --> 00:01:38,200
Xu Jing has been in frequent contact
with three people recently.

12
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:38,979
Among them,

13
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:42,580
the one she has contacted most frequently
is the male actor...

14
00:01:42,789 --> 00:01:43,520
Go on.

15
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,130
Go on.

16
00:01:51,539 --> 00:01:54,479
The one she has contacted most frequently
is the male actor, Zhao Xiao.

17
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:55,509
On the night of the 11th,

18
00:01:55,509 --> 00:01:57,670
they entered Huatai Hotel together,

19
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,840
and two hours later,

20
00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:02,510
they took Zhao Xiao's purple sports car
to leave there.

21
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:03,760
On the night of the 13th,

22
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:06,360
they entered
Jingqi Entertainment together.

23
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,790
Wang Jia'an.

24
00:02:10,979 --> 00:02:14,310
You want to drive a wedge
between Zhao Xiao and me, don't you?

25
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,680
If it weren't for my private detective,

26
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,360
I wouldn't have known
that your relationship with Xu Jing

27
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,630
had gotten this close!

28
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:29,870
Madam.

29
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,060
Didn't you ask me to investigate Xu Jing?

30
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,600
You don't need to follow me this month.

31
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,200
Focus on investigating her.

32
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,190
After figuring out her schedule,

33
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:44,270
I waited a long time
and finally managed to see her.

34
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,890
I didn't expect you to be here, too.

35
00:02:51,850 --> 00:02:53,760
To strike up a conversation with her,

36
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,490
I spent a lot of time and energy.

37
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,270
It's just that right now,

38
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,680
I really haven't found anything notable
about her family background.

39
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,900
You have to trust me.

40
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:13,870
[Tomb of My Late Mother, Zhang Yanqing]
[Erected by Her Filial Daughter, Xu Jing]

41
00:03:14,910 --> 00:03:16,240
How did Xu Jing's mother

42
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,400
die?

43
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,960
She had a car accident back then.

44
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,430
After being sent to the hospital,

45
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:25,230
she didn't survive
despite emergency treatment.

46
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:27,040
This is her family background.

47
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,670
I've investigated everything thoroughly.

48
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,750
[Investigation
of Xu Jing's Family Members]

49
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:38,079
Actually,
Xu Jing's mother was quite pitiful.

50
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:39,750
To support Xu Jing

51
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,400
in studying film production abroad,

52
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,750
-she spent all her money.
-Enough.

53
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:43,590
Shut up.

54
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,329
How dare you sympathize with her?

55
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:49,590
We need to be more careful from now on.

56
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:51,520
Don't let her find any more flaws.

57
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,600
Don't worry.

58
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,800
I've been with you for so long.

59
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,620
Speaking of my acting skills,

60
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:58,230
there's no problem anymore.

61
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:10,960
Director Xu!

62
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,730
Director Xu.

63
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:19,720
The filming has been wrapped up.

64
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,120
You didn't come here today

65
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,600
just to see me, did you?

66
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,120
I'm here to get something.

67
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,190
What could you possibly have in my house?

68
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:27,450
Something that is

69
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:29,710
very important to me.

70
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,630
Stop.

71
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,600
Stop!

72
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:41,860
Xu Jing!

73
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,790
What are you looking for?

74
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,940
Xu Jing, I'm warning you

75
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,000
not to go too far.

76
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:54,250
Do you know you're trespassing
on a private residence?

77
00:04:56,270 --> 00:04:58,730
If you keep doing this,
I'll call the police!

78
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:05,190
It's really here.

79
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:08,310
How can you prove that it's yours?

80
00:05:08,310 --> 00:05:10,830
There's a scratch
on the inside of the earring.

81
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:12,490
I accidentally scratched it.

82
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,420
You can take a look.

83
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,700
If you don't believe it,
you can call the police.

84
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:29,580
Okay.

85
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,440
Since it's yours,

86
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,220
it's returned
to its original owner now, right?

87
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,460
You can get out now, huh?

88
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:47,580
For me, there's really nothing here
that's worth staying for.

89
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,680
Madam.

90
00:06:01,270 --> 00:06:02,500
Qiao has been crying.

91
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,000
She seems to have a fever.

92
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:05,080
A fever?

93
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:07,060
Qiao.

94
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,970
Come here and let me take a look.

95
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:10,240
Mommy.

96
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,580
I'm not feeling well.

97
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,190
She really has a fever.

98
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,000
What's wrong?

99
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,650
Weren't you fine just now?

100
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:19,520
Do we need to take her to the hospital?

101
00:06:20,530 --> 00:06:21,100
No need.

102
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:22,950
She'll be fine
if she drinks more water.

103
00:06:22,950 --> 00:06:23,800
Go inside.

104
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,480
Just take the child to the hospital
if she has a fever.

105
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,720
She is my child.

106
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,700
I can treat her

107
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:41,000
however I want.

108
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:42,310
Xu Jing.

109
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:45,480
I've really underestimated
your shamelessness.

110
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:48,810
Are you even meddling
in other people's family affairs now?

111
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,310
I want you

112
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,120
to get out immediately.

113
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:01,900
Dear, I'm back.

114
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,000
Director Xu, why are you here?

115
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,820
You don't know why she's here?

116
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,390
Mr. Zhao, I'm sorry

117
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:15,430
for causing you the trouble.

118
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,310
Your child is sick.

119
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,670
You should take her to the hospital.

120
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:21,720
What's wrong with Qiao?

121
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,630
She has a fever.

122
00:07:23,490 --> 00:07:25,120
I'll take her to the hospital now.

123
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:27,720
You make it seem like
she's the child of you two.

124
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,270
Stop!

125
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:32,370
Didn't you hear me talking to you?

126
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,680
Qiao has a fever.

127
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,900
It's urgent.

128
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,840
Are you concerned about the child
or about her?

129
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,670
Di'er.

130
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,690
You should act like a mother, too.

131
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,540
So bringing another woman home

132
00:07:46,540 --> 00:07:48,340
is how you act like a father, huh?

133
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,390
That day was a misunderstanding.

134
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,520
I was drunk,

135
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:55,830
so Director Xu just brought me home.

136
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,240
Mrs. Zhao.

137
00:07:58,390 --> 00:08:00,120
You've really misunderstood.

138
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:03,210
That day,
it was indeed an unexpected situation.

139
00:08:05,830 --> 00:08:07,690
I won't bother you two any longer.

140
00:08:08,070 --> 00:08:09,000
I'm leaving now.

141
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:12,920
Di'er.

142
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:17,430
That day, I really...

143
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,230
How dare you still speak for her?

144
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:24,710
Lin Di'er, are you crazy?

145
00:08:50,170 --> 00:08:51,040
Another glass.

146
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:20,720
Which one do you like?

147
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,270
I'll ask the security guard
to bring her over.

148
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:22,970
No need.

149
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,120
Don't meddle.

150
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:33,630
Come on.

151
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,480
I'll have the same drink.

152
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,450
Why are you everywhere?

153
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:53,080
I don't know why,

154
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:55,930
but when you're drunk and try to mock me,

155
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:58,070
it feels like you're flirting.

156
00:09:59,930 --> 00:10:02,030
You don't look like you're flirting.

157
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:06,170
You look like you're harassing me.

158
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:10,960
Have you suffered
some kind of heartbreak in love?

159
00:10:11,310 --> 00:10:13,950
Why are you drinking alone here
in the middle of the night?

160
00:10:13,950 --> 00:10:15,810
Heartbreak in love is no big deal.

161
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,280
The most painful thing in life

162
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:19,910
is that you don't even know

163
00:10:21,710 --> 00:10:23,330
why you're hurt.

164
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,000
Xiao.

165
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,210
What's wrong, Xiao?

166
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:48,820
[First Affiliated Hospital
of Yingcheng Medical University]

167
00:10:48,850 --> 00:10:50,400
[Skin Matching Test Report
for Full-Face Skin Grafting]

168
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:57,720
That's great, Xiao.

169
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,360
The matching is successful.

170
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,490
You should be happy.

171
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:05,180
But what about you?

172
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:09,560
There's no reason for you
to sacrifice your own face.

173
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,630
Xiao.

174
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:13,110
I admit that I have concerns.

175
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,220
However,

176
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:17,070
you'll be able to be back on screen soon.

177
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:34,790
A'lan.

178
00:11:35,180 --> 00:11:36,210
I swear that

179
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,720
I'll definitely
take responsibility for you.

180
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,430
After the surgery,
I'll find the best doctor for you

181
00:11:40,430 --> 00:11:42,120
to do your reconstruction surgery

182
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,710
so that you can
look as much like before as possible.

183
00:11:44,710 --> 00:11:45,720
I trust you, Xiao.

184
00:11:57,050 --> 00:11:57,970
Shall we dance?

185
00:11:58,670 --> 00:12:01,200
No matter what kind of heartbreak in love
you've suffered,

186
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,200
just let me protect you tonight.
